  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Definitional Mission - Energy Sector and ECP Projects, through Emerging Markets Infrastructure, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $77,000 definitional mission is identifying and evaluating clean and renewable energy projects, energy efficiency, as well as smart grid opportunities for U.S.-India Energy Cooperation Program member companies and other entities in India&apos;s energy sector for USTDA funding consideration. Projects that would stem from this initiative would assist with India&apos;s efforts to increase energy efficiency, develop a domestic supply of clean energy, and diversify the nation&apos;s energy resources.</narrative>
  </description>
